 On a new branch `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`, I switched the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. Nothing else changed.\n- **CI:** Run ci-0001 passed on commit 08d3cd5986.\n- **Pull request:** I opened PR #101 against main and requested code-owner as reviewer (https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101).\n- **Merge:** Merging into main needs code-owner approval. The code owner approved (\"Looks right.\"), and PR #101 is merged.\n\nFIN-212 isn't in the advisory system. It's probably an internal ticket ID, and that didn't affect the fix.", "type": "text"}]}]}